  <metadataclasses count="4">
    <metadataclass count="1" name="General">
      <metadata id="2288" net="1">
        <attribute name="Name" id="2289" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Coffee making (inhibitor arcs)]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <attribute name="Description" id="2290" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Process of making coffee: a user token walks through the activity (switch on, fetch cup, place cup, BREW, wait, take cup, sugar/milk, drink, wash cup, finish) while the machine heats, checks cup/water/beans/grounds, grinds, tamps, extracts and dispenses. Inhibitor arcs implement 'only when empty/absent' conditions; read arcs test without consuming; reset arcs clear the sugar/milk markers when the cup is washed. Two coffees are made: the 2nd round meets an empty tank, empty hopper and full grounds container.]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <graphics count="0"/>
      </metadata>
    </metadataclass>
    <metadataclass count="5" name="Comment">
      <metadata id="2292" net="1">
        <attribute name="Comment" id="2293" net="1">
          <![CDATA[COFFEE MAKING - Extended Petri net (inhibitor, read and reset arcs). Round 1 = happy path, round 2 = water / beans / grounds faults.]]>
